#. <CLT 4>ここは女子トイレだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the girls bathroom.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 4>Đây là nhà vệ sinh nữ.\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>入っちゃダメだ入っちゃダメだ入っちゃダメだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Gotta resist... Gotta resist... Gotta resist...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>「ガチャ、ガチャ…」
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>*Rattle rattle*\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
"<CLT 23>“Lạch cạch lạch cạch!”\n"
"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>鍵が…掛かってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's...locked.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここの鍵は大神さんが壊してくれたって、
#. 霧切さんは言ってたけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko said Sakura had broken the lock on this door.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう直されたって事か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Does that mean it's been fixed already...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そりゃそうだ…そんなに甘くないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, I should've known it wouldn't be that easy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
